#! The one-truth subject. `traits/golden_missing_bound.lu` carries
#! `//! check: fail(E0501)`, so the corpus itself pins the code; this asserts
#! the editor surface reports the same one, at the same span, with both
#! secondary sites as relatedInformation. Message prose is compared under the
#! transcript default (not exact) — D22 owns the wording upstream, and
#! `lspconf onetruth` is the one place it is pinned to the sentence.
name      diagnostics/broken-e0501
profile   minimal

initialize
open      traits/golden_missing_bound.lu
wait      diagnostics traits/golden_missing_bound.lu
shutdown
